msgid "Fill the box. Six tumbles and you're out."
msgstr "상자를 채워요. 여섯 번 떨어지면 끝!"

msgid "Land Kinu in the tofu box. Anything that bounces out onto the counter is a tumble, and six tumbles end the run. You score the pile you keep."
msgstr "키누를 두부 상자에 올려요. 받침대로 떨어지면 실수이고, 여섯 번이면 끝나요. 남은 더미가 점수예요."

msgid "Best score"
msgstr "최고 점수"

msgid "Matched Your Best!"
msgstr "최고 기록과 같아요!"

msgid "So Close!"
msgstr "아깝다!"

msgid "Great Run!"
msgstr "멋진 판!"

msgid "Nice Pile!"
msgstr "멋진 더미!"

msgid "Best Toss score"
